---
description: Database and migrations
globs: db/**/*.sql
alwaysApply: false
---
- PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector. Forward-only Flyway; never edit applied migrations; add `V012+` with a header comment (stories/screens).
- TEXT+CHECK enums, TIMESTAMPTZ, UUID (gen_random_uuid) for external ids, pence for money.
- Learner data cascades on student delete; `audit_log` is append-only. RLS policies for any new school-tenant table (use `rls_school_ok`).
- `tutor_gateway` role may only touch AI-ops tables — never grant it learner tables.
- Add indexes with the query that needs them; explain-analyse critical queries.
